  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Stakeholder mapping and analysis LSH Kisumu and Homa Bay</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This study fits in the new multi-annual strategy of the Netherlands embassy in Nairobi, Kenya as Life Science &amp; Health (LSH) is one of the &apos;combi-tracks&apos; under the new strategy.There are already several market studies carried out on the LSH sector, but a deep understanding of the dynamics between public and private stakeholders is still missing.Therefore, the outcomes of this study will support the combi-track development to define interventions that are based on the real bottlenecks and incentives in the domain of primary healthcare in the county of Kisumu.</narrative>
  </description>
